Program ABI: read one JSON object from the request file given as the first command-line argument, write one JSON object to the response file given as the second argument.

Input object: Nums holds a list of numbers and K a window size.

The program must add the last K entries of Nums under Total, or 0 when K is zero. One small routine owns this computation.
